## Database Conventions

### Naming

- Shared tables: `users`, `tokens`, `bundles`, `purchases`, `referrals`, `feedback`, `game_sessions`, `judge_cache`
- Game-specific tables: prefixed with game name — `survey_packs`, `surveys`, `survey_collections`, `survey_showdown_results`
- All new game tables must follow the same prefix convention

### game_sessions table

`game_id` column identifies which game the session belongs to. Survey Showdown
always writes `game_id = "survey_showdown"`. Never query game_sessions without
filtering by game_id unless you intentionally want cross-game data.

### Migrations

- Always use `prisma migrate dev --name <descriptive-name>` for new migrations
- Never edit migration files after they've been applied
- Staging and local share the same Supabase project — run migrations once to cover both

