## Environment & Mock Mode

### Three environments

| Environment | Supabase Project            | Stripe Keys  |
|----|----|-----|
| Local       | good-night-games-staging   | sk_test_...  |
| Staging     | good-night-games-staging   | sk_test_...  |
| Production  | good-night-games-production | sk_live_... |

### NEXT_PUBLIC_MOCK_MODE

Mock/simulate buttons MUST be gated:

```tsx
const isMockMode = process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_MOCK_MODE === 'true';
{isMockMode && <button onClick={handleSimulate}>🧪 Simulate...</button>}
```

Present in `.env.local` and Railway staging. Intentionally absent from Railway
production — Next.js compiles these branches out at build time.

Mock elements that must be gated (complete list):
- "🧪 SIMULATE EMAIL LINK CLICK" (AuthModal — verify state)
- "🧪 SIMULATE EMAIL LINK CLICK" (AuthModal — magic-sent state)
- "🧪 Simulate a friend claiming their tokens" (ReferralModal)
- "MOCK VERIFY" (VerificationBanner)

