## Content & Legal Rules

### Survey content

- All survey questions and answers are 100% original
- NEVER use questions, answers, or question formats from Family Feud, survey databases,
  or any third-party content
- Avoid questions that could be interpreted as based on real proprietary survey data
- No references to specific brands, celebrities, or trademarked properties in survey content

### Game mechanics

- The core mechanic is inspired by the public domain "survey game" format — do not
  use the name "Family Feud", any Fremantle/CBS branding, or any associated trade dress
- The name "Survey Showdown" and "Good Night Games" are original — preserve them

### User data

- Never log personally identifiable information (PII) to console in any environment
- Never expose service role keys, stripe secret keys, or Anthropic API keys to the client
- User emails are only shown in UI elements the owner can see (account dropdown, verify banner)
- Referral simulate buttons are dev-only — see mock mode section above

