## Common Mistakes to Avoid

1. **Using emoji coins** — always use `<TokenSVG size={n}/>`, never 🪙
2. **Bypassing startGame** — never call commitGame directly from UI events
3. **Mutating tokens in child components** — always call `onTokensUpdated` up the tree
4. **Inline colors** — always use CSS variables for design system colors
5. **Wrong fonts** — only Exo 2, Bebas Neue, and DM Sans
6. **Mock buttons without NEXT_PUBLIC_MOCK_MODE guard** — all simulate/mock buttons must be gated
7. **Missing game_id** — every history write and judge cache entry requires game_id
8. **Querying surveys without RLS** — always filter by user_id; never return other users' surveys
9. **Deleting collection with surveys** — collections delete independently; surveys become uncategorized
10. **Adding IP-adjacent survey content** — all content must be wholly original
